{"title": "Ethel's Twisted Blessing", "pageid": 26335, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ethel's_Twisted_Blessing", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Blood.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Generic_Blood.webp/300px-Generic_Blood.webp, /w/images/3/38/Generic_Blood.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Generic_Blood.webp/300px-Generic_Blood.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Generic_Blood.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Ethel's Twisted Blessing</b> is a passive feature available to Ethel's <a href=\"/wiki/Redcap\" title=\"Redcap\">Redcap</a> servants that gives them additional health, strength and constitution scores, and damage to their attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>As one of Ethel's loyal servants, this redcap has an additional 40 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a>, their <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> scores are increased +2, and their attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">1~12</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bert_Adams\" title=\"Bert Adams\">Bert Adams</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blunder_Bob\" title=\"Blunder Bob\">Blunder Bob</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Pete\" title=\"Flaming Pete\">Flaming Pete</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jatlo\" title=\"Jatlo\">Jatlo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Maggoty_Jim\" title=\"Maggoty Jim\">Maggoty Jim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Redcap_Boatswain\" title=\"Redcap Boatswain\">Redcap Boatswain</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Redcap_Mystic_Cannoneer\" title=\"Redcap Mystic Cannoneer\">Redcap Mystic Cannoneer</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Silas_Silvertongue\" title=\"Silas Silvertongue\">Silas Silvertongue</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Toes_Rischer\" title=\"Two-Toes Rischer\">Two-Toes Rischer</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715083903\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 728/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4490/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2681/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 733/5000000 bytes\nExtL